# Built from Forever's data: the quest rows of Thorium Point, Master Smith Burninate and Lokhtos
# Darkbargainer (reputation per turn-in from Forever's quest pages, which match the world database), the
# standing window of each repeatable (the world database's quest requirements: Burninate's Fiery Flux
# turn-ins only while Neutral, Gaining Acceptance only while Friendly, Lokhtos's turn-ins at any standing),
# Lokhtos's gossip and shop conditions (the shop opens at Friendly), his 29 recipes with their standing and
# price from Forever's client item table, and the drop tables of the materials (Incendosaur Scale: every
# Incendosaur, two to four; Fiery and Lava Cores, Core Leather and Blood of the Mountain from the Molten
# Core). The Thorium Brotherhood has no kill reputation. Neutral to Exalted is 42,000 reputation.
# Quest reputation and level: in Classic a quest pays less once it is 6 or more levels below you (a fifth
# off per level, down to a fifth); a Forever beta report had low quests paying in full. Only the Thorium
# Point quests (48-50) are affected; every turn-in quest here is level 60. Numbers leave out Diplomat.
# INGAME: Do the Thorium Point quests (48-50) pay 100 or 20 reputation at level 60?
# The way to the Grim Guzzler (the Shadowforge Key or the Ring of Law, then the Shadowforge Lock) is
# Classic's layout of Blackrock Depths; nothing shows Forever changing it.
# Left out: Secrets of the Colossus - Regal (8858, 200 reputation), a Silithus quest with no objectives in
# Forever's data. The client item table also ties two cloak enchanting formulas (Greater Fire and Greater
# Nature Resistance, Honored, 10g) to the Brotherhood, but no vendor in Forever's data sells them.
# INGAME: Does Lokhtos sell Formula: Enchant Cloak - Greater Fire Resistance (229008) or Greater Nature
# Resistance (229009) at Honored?
# ASSUMED: Chambermaid Pillaclencher's Pillow (Look at the Size of It!, 7704) lies in the Slag Pit's
# sleeping quarters (Classic flow; Forever's data has no spawn for the pillow, and the Classic quest that sent
# players there is not in Forever's data). In-game check: is the ornate pillow in the Slag Pit?
# ASSUMED: Lokhtos takes his turn-ins below Friendly once you have any Brotherhood reputation (Forever's
# quest data asks for 1 point; Classic players brought him materials from Honored on). In-game check: does
# Lokhtos offer Favor Amongst the Brotherhood while Neutral?
# INGAME: Is the Molten Core open? Blizzard's raid announcement for Forever names Barrow Deeps, Hyjal Summit
# and Onyxia's Lair; the Molten Core is in the client but not announced. Until it opens, Lokhtos's Fiery
# and Lava Cores and Core Leather cannot be had, and Dark Iron Ore carries Honored to Exalted.

step Thorium Point
  tip Thorium Point is the scaffolded camp on the north-west rim of the Cauldron, with a flight point. Everyone starts Neutral with the Brotherhood. These seven quests (level 48 to 50) pay 100 reputation each: 700 in all, 800 with the pillow below. In Classic a quest pays less once it is 6 or more levels below you, only 20 each at 60, so do them while you level through Searing Gorge if you can; your first turn-in shows which. Master Smith Burninate's What the Flux? also opens his Fiery Flux turn-ins, so it is needed at any level. The numbers in this guide leave out the Legacy perk Diplomat, which adds up to 10%.
  accept 7722                         -- Master Smith Burninate
  accept 7723                         -- Hansel Heavyhands
  accept 7724
  accept 7727
  accept 7728 object 179827           -- The Wanted/Missing/Lost & Found board
  accept 7729 object 179827
  accept 7701 object 179827 optional  -- Overseer Maltorius is elite

step Golems and Dark Iron dwarves
  tip Heavy War Golems and the Dark Iron Taskmasters and Slavers work all over the floor of the Cauldron below Thorium Point. The Smithing Tuyere drops from Dark Iron Steamsmiths at the furnaces in the middle, the Lookout's Spyglass from Dark Iron Lookouts on the southern ridges: about one in ten of each.
  kill 5854 x20 quest 7723.1          -- Heavy War Golem
  kill 5846 x15 quest 7729.1          -- Dark Iron Taskmaster
  kill 5844 x15 quest 7729.2          -- Dark Iron Slaver
  collect 18959 quest 7728.1          -- Smithing Tuyere, Dark Iron Steamsmiths
  collect 18960 quest 7728.2          -- Lookout's Spyglass, Dark Iron Lookouts

step Greater Lava Spiders
  tip The spiders roam the lava pools and plateaus of the south-west.
  kill 5858 x20 quest 7724.1

step The Slag Pit
  tip The Slag Pit is the cave in the north of the Cauldron. The Secret Plans: Fiery Flux lie on a bench on its upper ledge, beside Overseer Maltorius: a level 50 elite with guards, easy at 60, worth a group below 55. Incendosaurs swim in the lava pools inside and around the north rim; every one drops two to four Incendosaur Scales. Keep every scale: Burninate's turn-ins take two each. If you find Chambermaid Pillaclencher's ornate pillow in the dwarves' sleeping quarters, take it to Evonice Sootsmoker at Thorium Point for 100 more.
  collect 18922 quest 7722.1          -- Secret Plans: Fiery Flux
  kill 9318 x20 quest 7727.1          -- Incendosaur
  collect 18946 quest 7701.1 optional -- Head of Overseer Maltorius, elite: group up below 55
  accept 7704 optional                -- Chambermaid Pillaclencher's Pillow, if you find it

