step Imperial Plate, for Blacksmiths
  when skill Blacksmithing 265
  when level>=50
  zone Tanaris
  tip Blacksmiths with 265 skill can buy their way up with Thorium Bars: Derotain Mudsipper in Gadgetzan trades the Imperial Plate plans for bars, and each pays Brotherhood reputation. A Blue Light Bargain opens them (100). Belt 20 bars (100), Bracer 20 (100), Shoulders 20 (100), Boots 40 (150), Helm 50 (200), Chest 60 (200), Leggings 60 (200): 1,150 reputation for 270 Thorium Bars. They count at any standing, so do them before Burninate's turn-ins.
  level 50
  accept 7652 optional
  turnin 7652 optional
