step Heavy Leather, if you skin (Alliance)
  only Alliance
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip Only if you take the Heavy Leather turn-in below and skin it yourself: the yetis and mountain lions here (level 28 to 40) yield it. Ten per turn-in.
  collect 4234 x10 optional @38.2,91.9 -- Heavy Leather

step Heavy Leather, if you skin (Horde)
  only Horde
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip Only if you take the Heavy Leather turn-in below and skin it yourself: the wyverns, basilisks and scorpids here (level 28 to 40) yield it. Ten per turn-in.
  collect 4234 x10 optional @78.5,59 -- Heavy Leather

step Fiery Flux to Friendly
  zone Searing Gorge
  tip Neutral to Friendly is 3,000 reputation. Burninate takes Restoring Fiery Flux Supplies only while you are Neutral: 25 reputation for 2 Incendosaur Scales, 1 Coal and either 4 Iron Bars, 4 Kingsblood or 10 Heavy Leather. These are level 60 quests, so they always pay in full. After the 700 from the Thorium Point quests that is 92 turn-ins: 184 scales (about 60 Incendosaurs), 92 Coal (Burninate sells it at 5 silver: 4g 60s) and 368 Iron Bars, 368 Kingsblood or 920 Heavy Leather. If those quests paid you only 140 at 60, it is 115 turn-ins: 230 scales, 115 Coal (5g 75s) and 460 bars or Kingsblood or 1,150 Heavy Leather. Miners smelt the bars from Iron Ore, herbalists pick Kingsblood, skinners get Heavy Leather from beasts of level 28 to 40; all three sell on the Auction House. Pick whichever is cheapest for you, or mix them. Blacksmiths who did the Imperial Plate quests need 46 fewer turn-ins.
  collect 18944 x20 optional          -- Incendosaur Scale, 2 per turn-in
  buy 3857 x10 optional npc 14624     -- Coal, 1 per turn-in
  turnin 8241 direct optional         -- via Iron: 4 Iron Bars
  collect 3356 x4 optional            -- Kingsblood, 4 per turn-in
  turnin 7736 direct optional         -- via Kingsblood: 4 Kingsblood
  turnin 8242 direct optional         -- via Heavy Leather: 10 Heavy Leather
  rep 59 Friendly

step Gaining Acceptance to Honored
  zone Searing Gorge
  tip Friendly to Honored is 6,000 reputation. While you are Friendly Burninate takes Gaining Acceptance instead: 25 reputation for 4 Dark Iron Residue, 240 turn-ins and 960 residue in all. About a third of the Dark Iron dwarves in Blackrock Depths drop residue, sometimes several at once; it also sells on the Auction House. Dark Iron Ore or Molten Core materials at Lokhtos (next steps) count here too. Lokhtos's shop opens at Friendly: Flarecore Gloves 8g, Corehound Boots 15g, Molten Helm 16g, Dark Iron Bracers 7g, Enchant Weapon - Strength 3g, Transmute Elemental Fire 12g.
  collect 18945 x40 optional          -- Dark Iron Residue, 4 per turn-in
  turnin 7737 direct optional
  rep 59 Honored

step The Shadowforge Key
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Optional, and it saves every later trip to Lokhtos the Ring of Law fight. Franclorn Forgewright is a ghost in the middle of Blackrock Mountain: only the dead see him, so die in the mountain and walk to his tomb as a spirit. He sends you after Fineous Darkvire in Blackrock Depths, who always drops Ironfel; place it on Franclorn's monument in the Shrine of Thaurissan and the Shadowforge Key falls out. Blackrock Depths is a five-player dungeon: group up.
  accept 3801 optional                -- Franclorn Forgewright, as a ghost
  turnin 3801 optional
  accept 3802 optional
  collect 10999 quest 3802.1 optional @32.1,94.7 map 1427 -- Ironfel, Fineous Darkvire inside Blackrock Depths
  turnin 3802 optional @32.1,94.7 map 1427 -- Monument of Franclorn Forgewright, Shrine of Thaurissan in Blackrock Depths

step Lokhtos Darkbargainer to Revered
  zone Searing Gorge
  tip Honored to Revered is 12,000 reputation, all of it from Lokhtos Darkbargainer in the Grim Guzzler, the tavern deep in Blackrock Depths. The way there: with the Shadowforge Key, open the East Garrison door near the entrance; without it, win the Ring of Law and climb to the East Garrison. Pull the Shadowforge Lock there to lower the bridge to the Manufactory, the only way to the Guzzler. His Favor Amongst the Brotherhood turn-ins never stop counting: 1 Fiery Core, 1 Lava Core or 1 Blood of the Mountain for 200, 2 Core Leather for 150, 10 Dark Iron Ore for 50. To Revered that is 60 cores, 160 Core Leather or 2,400 Dark Iron Ore. The cores and the leather come only from the Molten Core, which is not among the first raids Blizzard has announced for Forever; until it opens, Dark Iron Ore is the way. Miners with 230 skill find Dark Iron Deposits around the Cauldron in Searing Gorge, across the Burning Steppes and inside Blackrock Depths, and a deposit now and then gives a Blood of the Mountain; the ore also sells on the Auction House. Honored opens Flarecore Mantle 18g, Flarecore Robe 6g, Lava Belt 6g, Black Dragonscale Boots 16g, Fiery Chain Girdle 9g, Dark Iron Helm 6g, Dark Iron Reaver 22g, Dark Iron Destroyer 22g and Enchant Weapon - Mighty Spirit 8g.
  goto 32.1,94.7 "Blackrock Mountain"
  collect 17010 x5 optional @32.1,94.7 -- Fiery Core: Firewalkers, Flameguards and Firelords in the Molten Core
  collect 17011 x5 optional @32.1,94.7 -- Lava Core: Lava Elementals, Lava Reavers and Molten Destroyers
  collect 17012 x2 optional @32.1,94.7 -- Core Leather: skin Ancient Core Hounds and Magmadar
  collect 11382 x1 optional           -- Blood of the Mountain: Molten Destroyers, sometimes a Dark Iron Deposit
  collect 11370 x10 optional          -- Dark Iron Ore: Dark Iron Deposits, Mining 230
  turnin 6643 direct optional @32.1,94.7 -- Fiery Core: 200
  turnin 6644 direct optional @32.1,94.7 -- Lava Core: 200
  turnin 6646 direct optional @32.1,94.7 -- Blood of the Mountain: 200
  turnin 6645 direct optional @32.1,94.7 -- 2 Core Leather: 150
  turnin 6642 direct optional @32.1,94.7 -- 10 Dark Iron Ore: 50
  rep 59 Revered

step A Binding Contract
  when has 17203
  when level>=60
  tip Carry a Sulfuron Ingot (Golemagg the Incinerator, the Molten Core) to Lokhtos and he offers you a contract: ask about the offer and take it. Handing in the contract with the ingot pays 200 reputation and Plans: Sulfuron Hammer, the hammer Blacksmiths later join with the Eye of Sulfuras into Sulfuras, Hand of Ragnaros.
  level 60
  accept 7604 optional                -- Thorium Brotherhood Contract, from Lokhtos
  collect 17203 quest 7604.1 optional @32.1,94.7 -- Sulfuron Ingot, already in your bags
  turnin 7604 optional @32.1,94.7

step Lokhtos Darkbargainer to Exalted
  tip Revered to Exalted is 21,000 more: 105 cores or Bloods, 280 Core Leather or 4,200 Dark Iron Ore. The Molten Core materials come from the raid, so a guild or the auction house does most of the work. Revered opens Flarecore Leggings 9g, Chromatic Gauntlets 9g, Corehound Belt 9g, Molten Belt 9g, Dark Iron Leggings 18g, Dark Iron Gauntlets 8g, Fiery Chain Shoulders 20g, Black Amnesty 7g, Blackfury 7g and Enchant Weapon - Mighty Intellect 10g. Exalted opens the epic weapon plans Ebon Hand, Blackguard and Nightfall (12g each) and Dark Iron Boots 8g.
  turnin 6643 direct optional @32.1,94.7 -- Fiery Core: 200
  turnin 6644 direct optional @32.1,94.7 -- Lava Core: 200
  turnin 6646 direct optional @32.1,94.7 -- Blood of the Mountain: 200
  turnin 6645 direct optional @32.1,94.7 -- 2 Core Leather: 150
  turnin 6642 direct optional @32.1,94.7 -- 10 Dark Iron Ore: 50
  rep 59 Exalted
